*   <strong>Uber</strong> - Recognized as the global ride leader, Uber oper=
ates in over 10,000 cities across 70 countries, offering a variety of mobil=
ity solutions and expanding into areas like food delivery (Uber Eats) and f=
reight.
*   <strong>Didi Chuxing (DiDi)</strong> - This Chinese giant is a dominant=
